// "Amber Sands" — Dune II: three Houses (Atreides, Harkonnen, Ordos) with their own special units and
// palace weapons. Structures stand only on rock; the MCV deploys into a construction yard that builds
// structures sidebar-style. Harvesters bring spice from the fields; spice is credited 1:1 and capped by
// the storage of the yard, refineries and silos. Spice fields do not grow back: new spice comes only from
// spice blooms, which burst into a field when a unit drives over them. Vehicles crush infantry.
// Sandworms roam the open sand, swallow units whole and submerge after a few meals.
// Unit limit: every unit takes 1 supply, every construction yard gives 25 (Dune II MaxUnit).
// Prices and hit points follow the public Dune II tables (the same data as tools/importers/dune2).
{
  "victory": "noStructures",
